1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
In Guangzhou it rains — you never open an umbrella.
广州落雨，却不用打伞

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,300
The secret is the qilou — arcade streets.
秘密是骑楼——有顶的街

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,700
Homes upstairs, a covered walkway below.
楼上住人，楼下遮雨走廊

5
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,000
The city built 40km of them in ten years.
十年间盖了近40公里

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,400
Paris arcades meet Lingnan rain wisdom.
巴黎拱廊，撞上岭南挡雨智慧

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,800
Double-tap if you'd shop this street in the rain.
想在骑楼下逛街的，点个赞

8
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,200
Some strips have stood since 1931.
有的骑楼街1931年就在了

9
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,600
"Lok yu" is Cantonese for rain — they mean it.
广东话"落雨",落=下

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,200
★ Expert Tip: walk Enning Road, the most intact stretch.
内行贴士：走恩宁路，保存最完整

11
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,000
Which arcade would you duck into first?
你会先钻进哪条骑楼？评论区见
